# ABB M2M Basic.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | ABB M2M Basic — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: abb-m2m-basic-modbus-protocol.pdf (Technical specification V1.0, 2CSG445012D0201)
# | - 3-phase energy and power quality meter, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers FC03 only.
# | - All values are 2-word (32-bit); Big-Endian (MSW first).
# | - Two register banks:
# | - Integer 32-bit bank at 0x1000 (= 4096 decimal): scaled integer readings
# | - Float 32-bit bank at 0x3000 (= 12288 decimal): IEEE 754 float, SI units (preferred)
# | - This TOML covers the Float 32-bit bank (cleaner, no scaling needed).
# | Energy accumulators at end of float bank are u32 (*100 scaled).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=4800–38400, 8N1/E1/O1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=ABB
@model=M2M Basic
@vendor_website=abb.com
@description=3-phase energy and power quality meter — phase/line V/I, P/Q/S/PF, displacement factor, angles, frequency, THD, unbalance, demands, energy (IEEE 754 float32 + u32 energy, FC03, Big-Endian, 0x3000 bank).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/abb-m2m-basic.toml; Source: abb-m2m-basic-modbus-protocol.pdf (Technical specification V1.0, 2CSG445012D0201). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

